92d31d2 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mq6luf3m-d73a4fe6ba144a1704b6244f3c3a1abe '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"290\">This time, in cooperation with the Polish Investment and Trade Agency (PAIH), we will be exhibiting at <strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"250\">Automechanika Mexico City<\/strong>, taking place from <strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"289\">July 8\u201310, 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"381\">We warmly invite you to visit us at the Polish National Pavilion, booth <strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"380\">no. 4844<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"499\">Let\u2019s discuss new business opportunities together. To schedule a meeting, please contact us at: <a href=\"mailto:export@venol.de\">export@venol.de<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"523\">See you in Mexico!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-421c1bf5d4c122db8f22821bc87bc328 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia